Optimization strategy for AWS DMS.
Save cost by stopping the DMS instance when not in use.
Use large instance during heavy load (e.g., full load of 10TB).
Use smaller instance during light load (e.g., CDC of 2TB over 30 days).
Automate the stop/start and swap using AWS tools like Lambda, EventBridge.
